The author also wrote a longer commentary, see (ID:7298).</note><idno type="APIS">5225</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work6743"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mngon rtogs rgyan gyi Tik chung</title><title xml:lang="bo">མངོན་རྟོགས་རྒྱན་གྱི་ཊིཀ་ཆུང</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1322-01-01" notAfter="1375-12-31">after 1322 before 1375</date><author ref="person:3916">bla ma dam pa bsod nams rgyal mtshan</author><note type="comment">Listed in A khu ching Shes rab rgya mtsho's Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 528, No. 11478: [bla ma dam pa bsod nams rgyal mtshan gyi] mngon rtogs rgyan gyi Tik chung).</note><idno type="APIS">6743</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work7298"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dbus dang mtha' rnam par 'byed pa'i 'grel pa dbu ma'i snang ba</title><title xml:lang="bo">དབུས་དང་མཐའ་རྣམ་པར་འབྱེད་པའི་འགྲེལ་པ་དབུ་མའི་སྣང་བ</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1322-01-01" notAfter="1375-12-31">after 1322 before 1375</date><author ref="person:3916">bla ma dam pa bsod nams rgyal mtshan</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">The author also wrote a topical outline of the Madhyāntavibhāga (ID:3748), see (ID:5225).</note><idno type="APIS">7298</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work7380"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">byang chub kyi spyod pa la 'jug pa'i rnam par bshad pa dgongs pa nges par gsal ba</title><title xml:lang="bo">བྱང་ཆུབ་ཀྱི་སྤྱོད་པ་ལ་འཇུག་པའི་རྣམ་པར་བཤད་པ་དགོངས་པ་ངེས་པར་གསལ་བ</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1338-01-01" notAfter="1338-12-31">1338</date><author ref="person:3916">bla ma dam pa bsod nams rgyal mtshan</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">Colophon cited in [PJ2RPFCM]: 141-142, as reported in [BAQ9MH4T]: 323, n. 161: bsod nams rgyal mtshan dpal pos | 'bru mang po'i lo | rta pa'i zla ba'i dkar phyogs kyi tshes brgyad la | chos grwa chen po dpal ldan sa skya'i gtsug lag kha